WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.725 --> 00:00:02.489
- This is some news sung,

00:00:02.489 --> 00:00:04.324
instead of spoken.

00:00:04.324 --> 00:00:06.437
In bad news...

00:00:06.437 --> 00:00:09.440
♫Farrah Abraham

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.900
♫Is getting a boob job

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.244
♫To fix her boob job

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:20.307
♫Poor Farrah Abraham♫

00:00:20.307 --> 00:00:21.468
In good news...

00:00:21.468 --> 00:00:22.791
(drum sticks hitting)

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:25.577
♫The Gilmore Girls are
coming back to Netflix

00:00:25.577 --> 00:00:30.523
♫And 30-year-old women all
around the world rejoice♫

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:32.938
In bad news...

00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:36.328
♫Donald Trump is still talking

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:39.416
♫Saying terrifically stupid things

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:42.533
♫And we can't stop

00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:46.202
♫Paying attention♫

00:00:46.202 --> 00:00:47.479
In good news...

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:48.779
(drum sticks hitting)

00:00:48.779 --> 00:00:51.287
♫We totally think we found aliens

00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:52.912
♫It's like a star and it flickers

00:00:52.912 --> 00:00:55.420
♫It's so totally aliens

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.836
♫It's like a superstructure

00:00:56.836 --> 00:00:59.553
♫Like a big old scaffolding around a star♫

00:00:59.553 --> 00:01:01.552
I'm super amped about it, super amped.

00:01:01.552 --> 00:01:03.944
- So exciting, we'll
get hoverboards finally.

00:01:03.944 --> 00:01:04.663
- Oh, for sure.

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:05.987
Also good news,

00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:07.287
♫Star Wars♫

00:01:07.287 --> 00:01:08.053
(sigh)

00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:09.934
Took me six hours to get tickets though.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:12.111
Oh, Yoda.

00:01:14.837 --> 00:01:16.550
That's it.

